              "quote": "| B02 Product mix | Documentary Fact | Power & Control: actuators, ignition/engine technology, pumps/valves, motors, batteries, sensors, hoists and microwave electronics. Airframe: latches, rods/seals, security/displays, restraints, interiors, lighting, parachutes and testing. Non-aviation: ground restraints, space actuators, gas-turbine controls and heavy-equipment refueling. S1 p.5: “Products are sold in the original equipment and aftermarket market channels.” CP-1 SG04/SG08/SG09 retain segment sales below. | Diverse component families reduce single-product dependency, but segment mix and end-market cycles still affect earnings → preserve all three segments and do not equate diversification with immunity to aircraft-sector shocks. Individual product revenue/margin shares: Not disclosed. |"
