          "text": "| Company description | Documentary Fact | B01 — United States aerospace-components business operating through TransDigm Inc.; S1 p.4: “designer, producer and supplier of highly engineered aircraft components”; S1 p.1 supplies jurisdiction and headquarters. “Leading” is deliberately not adopted. | Specialized components on commercial and military aircraft create installed-base service demand → assess recurring replacement demand rather than treat all sales as aircraft deliveries. Platform economics are estimates in B04, not guaranteed orders. |",
