          "hidden": false,
          "data_type": null,
          "number_format": null,
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 58",
          "text": "| B07 Customers / routes to market | Documentary Fact | S1 pp.5–7 list OEMs, system suppliers, airlines, maintenance providers, military agencies/depots and distributors. S1 p.6: “We also use a number of distributors to provide logistical support”; Boeing Distribution Services and Satair are named major distributors. | Direct technical selling and distributor channels connect installed-base demand to orders; distributor stocking can distort near-term shipments → customer sales are not automatically end-user consumption, and quoted concentration is not platform concentration. Distributor-specific sales: Not disclosed. |",
