        {
          "locator": "line 161",
          "text": "**Capital allocation.** X01–X06 and CP-1 financial rows show acquisitions and shareholder returns alongside refinancing. Asset purchases may add earnings but need integration and contribution testing; distributions remove resources without adding operating earnings. S1 pp.115–120 records open measurement periods for FY2024 acquisitions, with pro forma results described as not material and not provided. This is not evidence of no earnings contribution or no integration risk. No forward earnings or synergy estimate is filled in. A named disposal register is unavailable despite CF09 sale gains; no proceeds use is invented.",
