          "cached_value": null,
          "hidden": false,
          "data_type": null,
          "number_format": null,
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 163",
          "text": "**Disclosure and controls.** GT05/GT08 provide supportive evidence from actual reconciliations and audited reporting, not from a proxy-incorporation sentence. S1 pp.56–57 excludes acquired-company controls from the ICFR scope while retaining those companies in consolidated financial statements. S1 p.104 identifies goodwill valuation as a critical audit matter, with sensitivity to discount rates, growth and EBITDA margins; this is estimation sensitivity, not an adverse audit opinion. CP-1 C03–C05 below qualify particular definition uses; C02 records withdrawal of the host/model maturity error, not an issuer inconsistency. No broad poor-disclosure conclusion or score is drawn from missing proxy material.",
