          "locator": "line 49",
          "text": "**Assessment — Analyst Interpretation; confidence Medium: TD Group's installed-base component franchise and improving historical operating cash generation mitigate business risk, but debt-funded shareholder distributions and rising carrying leverage limit creditor benefit from those earnings; retained liquidity, forward refinancing capacity and legal headroom are not established. Basis: CP-1 IS01/IS06, CF22/CF23, K07/K09/K12, BS14/SE03; CP-1A B03/B04/B10, BF01, CT01–CT05.**",
