        {
          "locator": "line 51",
          "text": "**Thesis — Analyst Interpretation: Durable replacement demand can support debt service, but the credit case depends on converting that demand into retained cash rather than acquisitions and shareholder payouts, with no assumed sponsor rescue, unrestricted cash offset or repeat refinancing access. Basis: CP-1 CF22/CF24/CF28, K02/K09; CP-1A B03/B04, X01/X02/X04, GT04, CT02/CT03.**",
