          "cached_value": null,
          "hidden": false,
          "data_type": null,
          "number_format": null,
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 142",
          "text": "The issuer's 6,261 consolidated cash is **not an unqualified recovery offset**. It precedes the 4,216 accrued common dividend, with October common/equivalent payments 4,216/132 and subsequent A/R draw 162.5 (CP-1 BS01/BS14/SE02/SE03; S1 pp.105,131,146). These later events are not blended into September balances or FY2024 cash flow; no complete post-event cash balance is constructed. Cash may also require entity/location, security, restriction and operating-need analysis. Likewise, reported available revolver 843 is not cash, and nominal A/R capacity 650 less drawn is not certified availability. Carrying leverage remains an accounting analytical ratio, not principal-based recovery coverage or legal headroom.",
          "formula": null,
