          "text": "No portfolio identity, mandate, holdings, NAV, concentration limits, liquidity horizon, leverage/derivative rules, risk budget, eligible-security list or investment clearance is supplied. Therefore no binding portfolio constraint, mandate compliance, numeric sizing, current exposure or proposed pro forma exposure can be established. This is not evidence of a breach or zero capacity. No CLO eligibility is inferred from a loan label, and no loan/commitment is assumed transferable or available to purchase.",
