          "text": "The RV role makes exactly three **conditional research pitches**, not invented buy recommendations: **P1**, compare floating secured loans with fixed secured notes using price/call/tenor-adjusted returns rather than coupons (CP-3 security table); **P2**, test whether the documented 2033 guarantees/consents justify a price premium once reach is verified (CP-4 and CP-3); **P3**, test whether a discounted subordinated entry could compensate for senior/local claims and fit an actual portfolio (CP-3 countercase). Each pitch's implication is Insufficient Information for inclusion today. Invalidation signals are matched executable pricing for P1, adverse or incomplete security/entity proof for P2, and inadequate residual value or actual mandate headroom for P3. None asserts an existing discount, cheapness or compliance.",
