          "locator": "line 453",
          "text": "**Operating performance.** TransDigm's reported revenue and operating income both increased from FY2023 to FY2024 (IS01, IS06); K13 calculates increases of 1,355 and 608, with growth fractions 0.205771 and 0.208005. Gross and operating margins rose on the calculated K04–K05 definitions. All three segment revenue totals increased (SG04, SG08, SG09); SG01–SG07 show the relevant commercial/OEM, aftermarket and defense rows without attributing the consolidated increase to an untested price/volume/organic cause. The source explains that segments reflect internal performance reporting and corporate reconciliation, not independent legal obligors (S1 pp.140–142). No forecast follows from these historical comparisons.",
